<newsitem itemid="126292" id="root" date="1996-10-18" xml:lang="en">
<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Cargo half year share, div steady.</title>
<headline>Cargo half year share, div steady.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Aug 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     21.7	  vs 21.5</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 3.0	   vs 3.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   4.34	  vs 4.30</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   6.04	  vs 5.83</p>
<p>    Tax			 1.70	  vs 1.54</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   3.39	  vs 1.63</p>
<p>    Turnover		  120.22	vs 112.45</p>
<p>Full name: Cargo Carriers Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said they believed a restructuring in the last financial year put the company in a better position in a very competitive road transport environment.</p>
<p>They said the benefits of a fleet renewal and the restructuring should be reflected in the near future.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
